                <mxCell id="5" value="Failure mode:&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;- manifest has to be SUCCESS&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Ensure audit table is created for the &lt;b&gt;specific dataset&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;id AND that&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;run directories and manifests agree with the dataset id.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Otherwise, fail fast.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFCCCC;strokeColor=#FF550F;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=14;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
